# Dart Style (This Repo)

- Prefer **double-quoted** string literals.
- Prefer **Title Case** for user-visible labels and menu items. Keep **sentence case** (or platform default) only for top-level scaffold titles and similar very top-level chrome if that matches existing screens.
- Match surrounding files for imports, naming, and widget structure; do not introduce a second style in the same feature.
- Respect `analysis_options.yaml` and `flutter_lints`; do not disable or ignore lints in passing edits unless the user asks.
